==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ang}} {{term|lang=ang|aldormann}} or {{term|lang=ang|ealdormann}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|aldermen}}

# A member of several [[municipal]] [[legislative]] [[bodies]] in a [[city]] or [[town]].
# {{1811}}<!--{{context|obsolete|slang}}--> A roasted turkey, called an ''alderman in chains'' or an ''alderman hung in chains'' if garnished with sausages. (1811 ''Dictionary of Vulgar Tongue'')
# {{slang}} A [[man]]'s [[potbelly]].

